Title:
Minecraft 2.0


Basic idea:
You move around and look in the minecraft scene


Elements in the project:
steve, a pig, a house, a zombie and some blocks


Events:
clicking

Logic:
if you hit a zombie with an arrow you get 1 point
if the zombie touches you then you die
Misc:
you can choose the difficulty

MVP:
you shoot and zombie dies and if you touch the zombie you die

